{"4324480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dirty Business", "steam_appid": 4324480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Add To Wishlist</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1785492302\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>Join Our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/de1510c672211003f69807b1d3fd3887.avif?t=1785492302\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, upgrade, and expand an underground criminal operation beneath the city. Produce drugs, weapons, counterfeit money, and other illegal activities. Hire workers, grow your gang, optimize production, operate secret cartel airstrip and expand into city-wide distribution. Take control of districts and build your empire from the shadows in single-player or co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Illegal Production</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/aadc102029ccad35fe8243337aa3b6ff.poster.avif?t=1785492302\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/aadc102029ccad35fe8243337aa3b6ff.webm?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/aadc102029ccad35fe8243337aa3b6ff.mp4?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce multiple drugs, counterfeit different currencies, and manufacture various weapons. Complete customer orders or sell them directly for maximum profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Control Distribution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/6bd45e9a23b80b8b6fffed449bc66ef4.poster.avif?t=1785492302\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/6bd45e9a23b80b8b6fffed449bc66ef4.webm?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/6bd45e9a23b80b8b6fffed449bc66ef4.mp4?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send small and medium orders to the surface via elevator, and use front company vehicles for larger shipments.<br>Dispatch massive orders from your <strong>secret cartel airstrip</strong> to distant parts of the city and across the country.<br>Handle distribution yourself or hire street dealers to move products across the city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build Your Crew</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/8a49c22e722e946a4cabe1cfd80fc043.poster.avif?t=1785492302\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/8a49c22e722e946a4cabe1cfd80fc043.webm?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/8a49c22e722e946a4cabe1cfd80fc043.mp4?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire workers to grow plants, produce chemical drugs, and manufacture weapons, then hire street dealers to handle drug sales across the city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Upgrade Your Underground Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/a46b08a1f36e0c4cae7011e99c85e66a.poster.avif?t=1785492302\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/a46b08a1f36e0c4cae7011e99c85e66a.webm?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/a46b08a1f36e0c4cae7011e99c85e66a.mp4?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand and upgrade your underground base over time, unlock side production rooms, and open an underground garage to support a large-scale distribution fleet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play Solo or Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with up to 4 friends in co-op to build and grow your criminal empire together.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, upgrade, and expand an underground criminal operation beneath the city. Produce drugs, weapons, counterfeit money, and other illegal activities. Hire workers, grow your gang, optimize production, operate secret cartel airstrip and expand into city-wide distribution. Take control of districts and build your empire from the shadows in single-player or co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Illegal Production</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/aadc102029ccad35fe8243337aa3b6ff.poster.avif?t=1785492302\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/aadc102029ccad35fe8243337aa3b6ff.webm?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/aadc102029ccad35fe8243337aa3b6ff.mp4?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce multiple drugs, counterfeit different currencies, and manufacture various weapons. Complete customer orders or sell them directly for maximum profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Control Distribution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/6bd45e9a23b80b8b6fffed449bc66ef4.poster.avif?t=1785492302\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/6bd45e9a23b80b8b6fffed449bc66ef4.webm?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4324480/extras/6bd45e9a23b80b8b6fffed449bc66ef4.mp4?t=1785492302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span